WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:01,300
As long as the iron door is locked

2
00:00:01,300 --> 00:00:07,090
The beasts will never be able to get in and go up to the sky

3
00:00:08,920 --> 00:00:10,880
If you don’t pick so many unique fruits,

4
00:00:10,880 --> 00:00:12,480
In a few days, everything will rot on the tree

5
00:00:12,480 --> 00:00:14,160
Even if it sells for 200 yuan per catty on earth,

6
00:00:14,160 --> 00:00:15,080
There are people queuing up to buy

7
00:00:15,080 --> 00:00:16,840
If it's all rotten, it's like a violent thing.

8
00:00:16,840 --> 00:00:17,880
While waiting to return to the city

9
00:00:17,880 --> 00:00:20,320
I have to find time to pick a few bags and bring them back to reality. Don’t worry.

10
00:00:20,320 --> 00:00:21,600
All the good stuff is up there

11
00:00:22,970 --> 00:00:25,210
It seems that as long as it is not Daqianxi or snatching food,

12
00:00:25,210 --> 00:00:29,080
These fierce signers will not attack me for nothing. This is

13
00:00:29,080 --> 00:00:34,070
Giant wild grapes as big as goose eggs

14
00:00:35,720 --> 00:00:40,170
Even the birds and squirrels enjoyed it so much. It’s definitely not poisonous and too sweet.

15
00:00:40,170 --> 00:00:41,090
plenty of juice

16
00:00:41,090 --> 00:00:43,730
Ten times more delicious than all the top fruits on earth

17
00:00:43,730 --> 00:00:44,810
Eat this every day

18
00:00:44,810 --> 00:00:47,290
You don’t even have to cook. It’s okay. I’m full.

19
00:00:47,290 --> 00:00:50,410
I'll pick two more bunches and take them back, but what's over there?
